{"unit_id":"PenguinAndy__dsh-ezcommit-plugin#feature-1","repo":"PenguinAndy/dsh-ezcommit-plugin","commit":"eebfb349acc07ec04dfdef1164e27d4aa4478bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-EZ Commit 的功能「仓库状态与分支显示」：会话标题栏显示当前分支，并轮询 Git 工作区状态；非仓库或没有改动时按钮禁用。进入会话即可查看，状态来自 Git 查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:198-250","src/index.js:292-325"]}
{"unit_id":"PenguinAndy__dsh-ezcommit-plugin#feature-2","repo":"PenguinAndy/dsh-ezcommit-plugin","commit":"eebfb349acc07ec04dfdef1164e27d4aa4478bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-EZ Commit 的功能「生成提交拆分计划」：点击按钮并启动分析后，Host 收集状态、差异和未跟踪文件样本，交由当前会话模型生成提交计划与文件分组。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:328-367","src/index.js:580-675"]}
{"unit_id":"PenguinAndy__dsh-ezcommit-plugin#feature-3","repo":"PenguinAndy/dsh-ezcommit-plugin","commit":"eebfb349acc07ec04dfdef1164e27d4aa4478bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-EZ Commit 的功能「审阅并执行批次」：分析后在弹窗中展示提交计划供用户确认；确认执行时逐批运行 Git add 和 commit，并返回每批的提交标题及短哈希。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:330-350","src/index.js:684-735"]}
{"unit_id":"PenguinAndy__dsh-ezcommit-plugin#feature-4","repo":"PenguinAndy/dsh-ezcommit-plugin","commit":"eebfb349acc07ec04dfdef1164e27d4aa4478bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-EZ Commit 的功能「识别无须提交的改动」：分析流程会让模型判断改动是否属于环境噪音；判为噪音时界面显示原因，不生成需要执行的提交批次。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:431-475","src/index.js:650-675"]}
